**The quest may not have been entered into the journal, despite completing the prior quest.  Use the console command <code>setstage dlc2mq06 200</code> then walk around the locked gate to trigger the next objective and he should arrive.
{{Bug|If you become fully hidden in sneak mode, Miraak will come out of his ethereal state and will continue the fight.|confirmed=1}}
{{Bug|When Miraak rises from the central pool of water impaled on a tentacle, his body may appear next to the tentacle rather than impaled on it. This does not affect the progression of the quest, however.|confirmed=1}}
{{Bug|Upon exiting the ethereal state you may be able to continue fighting Miraak, however should he re-enter his ethereal state a loop can occur where Miraak attempts to take the soul of one of his dragons. He may also become "fixated" on trying to absorb the soul of only one of his two dragons, consistently calling for one of the dragons even if both have already been sacrificed.|confirmed=1}}
{{Bug|After defeating Miraak, when the skill symbols are shown, heavy armor may not appear.|vn=1}}
**Reloading a save may fix this. 
{{Bug|At the end of quest when you beat Miraak, he may not be impaled by Hermaeus Mora.|confirmed=1}}
**{{Pc22}} One possible solution is to use the <code>disable</code> and <code>enable</code> console commands on Miraak. He will then be impaled.
